        "ai_gen_block_d149a36_qiiDEK": {
          "type": "ai_gen_block_d149a36",
          "name": "Refund policy content",
          "settings": {
            "eyebrow": "",
            "title": "",
            "policy_content": "<h2>4. Where Does GKU Ship?</h2><p>GKU ships to supported countries and regions worldwide, subject to product availability, local delivery services, and checkout eligibility.</p><p>Shipping availability may vary by product. The most accurate way to confirm whether we can ship a specific GKU product to your address is to enter your delivery information during checkout.</p><p>Orders may be fulfilled from different warehouses depending on your destination and available inventory.</p><h2>5. Local Warehouse Fulfillment</h2><p>GKU works with multiple warehouse locations to support order fulfillment in different countries and regions. Orders are assigned to warehouses based on destination, product availability, inventory levels, and logistics capacity.</p><p><strong>U.S. Warehouse Locations</strong></p><p>Some U.S. orders may be fulfilled from the following warehouse locations:</p><p><strong>Ontario, California Warehouse</strong><br/>3450 E. Philadelphia St., Ontario, CA 91761, USA</p><p><strong>San Jose, California Warehouse</strong><br/>184 Barnard Ave, San Jose, CA 95125, USA</p><p>Please note that not all products are stocked at these locations, and not all U.S. orders are shipped from these warehouses.</p><p><strong>Local Warehouse Fulfillment in Other Countries and Regions</strong></p><p>For orders from other countries and regions, GKU will make reasonable efforts to ship from local or nearby warehouses whenever possible, depending on product availability and local inventory.</p><p>If special circumstances affect the fulfillment location or shipping arrangements, our team will contact customers by email at <a href=\"mailto:support@gkutech.com\">support@gkutech.com</a> or through the email address provided with the order.</p><p>Warehouse selection is arranged automatically, and customers generally cannot manually select a fulfillment warehouse. If a product is unavailable at the nearest warehouse, the order may be fulfilled from another available location, which may affect the delivery time.</p><h2>6. Southeast Asia Shipping</h2><p>GKU currently supports shipping to the following Southeast Asian countries and regions:</p><ul><li>Singapore</li><li>Malaysia</li><li>Thailand</li><li>Indonesia</li><li>Philippines</li><li>Vietnam</li></ul><p>Available products and shipping options may vary by destination. Please check the options available at checkout.</p><h2>7. Estimated Delivery Times</h2><p>Estimated delivery times are as follows:</p><ul><li><strong>Express Shipping:</strong> 3–7 business days</li><li><strong>Standard Shipping:</strong> 5–10 business days</li></ul><p>Delivery estimates begin after the order has been processed and shipped.</p><p>Please note that actual delivery times may vary depending on the destination, warehouse location, carrier operations, weather conditions, public holidays, and other factors beyond our control.</p><h2>8. Order Tracking</h2><p>Once your order has been shipped, you will receive a shipping confirmation email containing your tracking number and tracking information.</p><p>You can use the tracking number to check the latest delivery updates through the carrier's website or the tracking link provided in your shipping confirmation email.</p><p>Please allow some time for tracking information to become available after shipment.</p><h2>9. Incorrect or Incomplete Shipping Address</h2><p>Customers are responsible for providing accurate and complete shipping information when placing an order.</p><p>Please double-check your shipping address, including the recipient's name, street address, city, state or province, postal code, and phone number.</p><p>GKU is not responsible for delivery issues caused by incorrect or incomplete address information provided by the customer.</p><p>If you notice an error in your shipping address, please contact us as soon as possible at <a href=\"mailto:support@gkutech.com\">support@gkutech.com</a>. We will do our best to assist, but changes cannot be guaranteed once an order has been processed or shipped.</p><h2>10. Delayed Shipments</h2><p>Although we work with reliable shipping carriers, delays may occasionally occur due to carrier operations, weather conditions, high shipping volumes, public holidays, or other unexpected circumstances.</p><p>If your order has not arrived within the estimated delivery window, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@gkutech.com\">support@gkutech.com</a> with your order number so we can help check its status.</p><h2>11. Delivered but Cannot Find Your Package</h2><p>If the tracking information shows that your package has been delivered but you cannot find it, we recommend that you:</p><ul><li>Check around your delivery location, including your mailbox, porch, garage, or other safe places.</li><li>Ask family members, neighbors, or building management if they accepted the package.</li><li>Contact the local carrier for additional delivery information.</li></ul><p>If you still cannot locate your package after 24 hours, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@gkutech.com\">support@gkutech.com</a> with your order number.</p><h2>12. Lost Packages</h2><p>If your package appears to be lost in transit or has not received tracking updates for an extended period, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@gkutech.com\">support@gkutech.com</a>.</p><p>Our team will work with the shipping carrier to investigate the shipment and help resolve the issue.</p><h2>13. Damaged Packages</h2><p>If your order arrives damaged, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@gkutech.com\">support@gkutech.com</a> as soon as possible.</p><p>To help us assess the situation, please provide:</p><ul><li>Your order number</li><li>Photos of the outer packaging</li><li>Photos of the damaged product and any visible damage</li></ul><p>Our team will review the information and assist you with the next steps.</p><h2>14. Split Shipments</h2><p>Depending on product availability and warehouse inventory, items in the same order may be shipped separately.</p><p>If your order is split into multiple shipments, you may receive separate shipping confirmation emails and tracking numbers for each package.</p><p>Please check all tracking updates before contacting us about missing items.</p><h2>15. Order Changes & Cancellations</h2><p>If you need to change or cancel your order, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@gkutech.com\">support@gkutech.com</a> as soon as possible.</p><p>We will do our best to assist with your request. However, changes or cancellations cannot be guaranteed once an order has been processed, packed, or shipped.</p><h2>16. Shipping Restrictions</h2><p>Shipping availability may vary depending on the destination, product type, local delivery services, and warehouse inventory.</p><p>Some products may not be available for delivery to certain countries or regions. Please check the shipping options displayed at checkout before placing your order.</p><p>GKU reserves the right to cancel an order if delivery to the provided address is not supported.</p><h2>17. Contact GKU Support</h2><p>If you have any questions or concerns about shipping, delivery, or your order, please contact us:</p><p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href=\"mailto:support@gkutech.com\">support@gkutech.com</a><br/><strong>WhatsApp:</strong> +86 147 7631 5502</p><p><strong>Customer Service Hours:</strong><br/>Monday–Friday, 9:30 AM–10:00 PM (Beijing Time, UTC+8)</p><p>Our team will be happy to assist you.</p>",
            "desktop_width_percent": 100,
